                                        <tbody><tr><td class="subheader class14">Liquidity Position</td></tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td class="class11">
                                                        <b> Strong </b>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                                                    <tr>
                                        <td class="class11">
                                            <span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:12px !important">­</span>The company has &nbsp;strong liquidity position as reflected by unencumbered assets of Rs. 4,212 Cr. of which cash and cash equivalents account&nbsp;for ~30 percent and securities held for trade (G-Sec, Mutual funds, etc.) account&nbsp;for ~45 percent. The company’s strong liquidity position is reflected by its ability to maintain sufficient liquidity cover, as the total debt obligations for FY2027, on a consolidated basis, stands at Rs. 6,418 Cr.
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
